//   - Y/X ratio: ~1.50 (consistent with equirectangular at ~48°N)
//
// Calibration anchor: Wien center 16.37°E, 48.21°N → SVG (550, 97)
//
// X: x = lon * SX + OX
//   SX = 78.55
